ralph/progress.txt:33430:  - The JobRepository surface has no Cancel() -- the equivalent state-transition surface is Transition(..., JobStatusCancelled, mut). The queued->cancelled edge is the representative cross-tenant probe (it exercises the locking SELECT, state-machine validator, UPDATE projection, and lease-release+finished_at-stamp bookkeeping all in one move). The orgB caller passes store.JobTransition with a non-empty ErrorSummary and the call MUST surface as yerr.CodeNotFound (NOT Conflict): the FOR UPDATE SELECT does not find the row under (organization_id = orgB.ID AND id = alpha.ID), so pgx.ErrNoRows maps to apierr.NotFound BEFORE the state-machine validator runs.
